; ROO311: the SWIs of the ShareFS module's ShareD interface, as far as ADFSFiler names them.
;
; ShareFS (Acorn Access) was not released as source and its exported header is not in the RISC OS Open
; tree. ADFSFiler offers its "Share" menu entries only when it finds the ShareFS module, so on a machine
; without it these SWIs are never called. The numbers are the public ones from the ShareD chunk.

        SUBT    ShareD SWIs => Hdr:ShareD

OldOpt  SETA    {OPT}
        OPT     OptNoList+OptNoP1List

SWIClass        SETS    "ShareD"

        ^       ShareDSWI_Base

        AddSWI  CreateShare
        AddSWI  StopShare
        AddSWI  EnumerateShares

        OPT     OldOpt
        END
